[
    {
        "content": "<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/113488-general/topic/Discussion.3A.20mathlib.20requiring.20the.20use.20of.20the.20module.20system/near/623623560\">A message</a> was moved here from <a class=\"stream-topic\" data-stream-id=\"113486\" href=\"/#narrow/channel/113486-General-announcements/topic/Mathlib.20requiring.20the.20use.20of.20the.20module.20system/with/623549666\">#General announcements &gt; Mathlib requiring the use of the module system</a> by <span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"634338\">Michael Rothgang</span>.</p>",
        "id": 627462655,
        "sender_full_name": "Notification Bot",
        "timestamp": 1790607101
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Would it help to have e.g. a command <code>lake modulize</code> which runs the above script on your project? (This would get you 90% of the way, in some projects even 95 or 99%.)</p>",
        "id": 627463084,
        "sender_full_name": "Michael Rothgang",
        "timestamp": 1790607181
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I would prefer a script to instructions for an LLM where possible<br>\nI'm not against using LLMs to bump but doing it unecessarily is extra effort and chance for bad edits</p>",
        "id": 627471103,
        "sender_full_name": "Artie Khovanov",
        "timestamp": 1790608597
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>well, the instructions for the LLM can be</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Run</p>\n<p><div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Bash\"><pre><span></span><code>$<span class=\"w\"> </span>wget<span class=\"w\"> </span>https://raw.githubusercontent.com/leanprover/lean4/refs/tags/v4.X.Y/script/Modulize.lean\n$<span class=\"w\"> </span>find<span class=\"w\"> </span>YourProject.lean<span class=\"w\"> </span>YourProject<span class=\"w\"> </span>-type<span class=\"w\"> </span>f<span class=\"w\"> </span>-name<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"*.lean\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>-print0<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>xargs<span class=\"w\"> </span>-0<span class=\"w\"> </span>lean<span class=\"w\"> </span>--run<span class=\"w\"> </span>Modulize.lean\n$<span class=\"w\"> </span>rm<span class=\"w\"> </span>Modulize.lean\n</code></pre></div><br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>but certainly having lake manage the lean version and lean_lib patterns would be helpful</p>",
        "id": 627472914,
        "sender_full_name": "Eric Wieser",
        "timestamp": 1790608917
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Though another option would be to just fold this into <code>Modulize.lean</code> by copying the approach of <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/pull/1850\">https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/pull/1850</a></p>",
        "id": 627473391,
        "sender_full_name": "Eric Wieser",
        "timestamp": 1790609006
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>The cache tool now prints lots of warnings <span aria-label=\"sweat smile\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f605\" role=\"img\" title=\"sweat smile\">:sweat_smile:</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler-block\"><div class=\"spoiler-header\">\n</div><div class=\"spoiler-content\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Bash\"><pre><span></span><code>$<span class=\"w\"> </span>lake<span class=\"w\"> </span>exe<span class=\"w\"> </span>cache<span class=\"w\"> </span>get\n⚠<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"m\">6</span>/41<span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>Replayed<span class=\"w\"> </span>Cache.IO\nwarning:<span class=\"w\"> </span>Cache/IO.lean:<span class=\"w\"> </span>missing<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"sb\">`</span>module<span class=\"sb\">`</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>header<span class=\"w\"> </span>as<span class=\"w\"> </span>required<span class=\"w\"> </span>by<span class=\"w\"> </span>the<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"sb\">`</span>requiresModuleSystem<span class=\"sb\">`</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>option\n⚠<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"m\">7</span>/41<span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>Replayed<span class=\"w\"> </span>Cache.Hashing\nwarning:<span class=\"w\"> </span>Cache/Hashing.lean:<span class=\"w\"> </span>missing<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"sb\">`</span>module<span class=\"sb\">`</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>header<span class=\"w\"> </span>as<span class=\"w\"> </span>required<span class=\"w\"> </span>by<span class=\"w\"> </span>the<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"sb\">`</span>requiresModuleSystem<span class=\"sb\">`</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>option\n⚠<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"m\">9</span>/41<span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>Replayed<span class=\"w\"> </span>Cache.Infra\nwarning:<span class=\"w\"> </span>Cache/Infra.lean:<span class=\"w\"> </span>missing<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"sb\">`</span>module<span class=\"sb\">`</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>header<span class=\"w\"> </span>as<span class=\"w\"> </span>required<span class=\"w\"> </span>by<span class=\"w\"> </span>the<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"sb\">`</span>requiresModuleSystem<span class=\"sb\">`</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>option\n⚠<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"m\">10</span>/41<span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>Replayed<span class=\"w\"> </span>Cache.Requests\nwarning:<span class=\"w\"> </span>Cache/Requests.lean:<span class=\"w\"> </span>missing<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"sb\">`</span>module<span class=\"sb\">`</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>header<span class=\"w\"> </span>as<span class=\"w\"> </span>required<span class=\"w\"> </span>by<span class=\"w\"> </span>the<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"sb\">`</span>requiresModuleSystem<span class=\"sb\">`</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>option\nwarning:<span class=\"w\"> </span>Cache/Requests.lean:<span class=\"w\"> </span>missing<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"sb\">`</span>module<span class=\"sb\">`</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>header<span class=\"w\"> </span>as<span class=\"w\"> </span>required<span class=\"w\"> </span>by<span class=\"w\"> </span>the<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"sb\">`</span>requiresModuleSystem<span class=\"sb\">`</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>option\n⚠<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"m\">11</span>/41<span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>Replayed<span class=\"w\"> </span>Cache.Marker\nwarning:<span class=\"w\"> </span>Cache/Marker.lean:<span class=\"w\"> </span>missing<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"sb\">`</span>module<span class=\"sb\">`</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>header<span class=\"w\"> </span>as<span class=\"w\"> </span>required<span class=\"w\"> </span>by<span cl